whole number is treated as in base R, without its warnings:
\itemize{
\item \code{nv_dpois()} takes an \code{x} within a relative \code{1e-9} of a whole
number, that is with
\eqn{|x - \mathrm{round}(x)| \le 10^{-9} \max(|x|, 1)}{|x - round(x)| <= 1e-9 * max(|x|, 1)},
